:: StoryTitle
The Fire of Destiny

:: StoryData
{
  "id": "fuoco-del-destino",
  "author": "Specula Elementae",
  "startPassage": "prologo"
}

:: prologo [opening]
Ember warms your hands like a kind little campfire. Fire can give light and warmth, but you must be careful when you use it.

[[Continue->nemici-modificati]]

:: nemici-modificati [game-effect]
Ember keeps you warm and gives you courage. The enemy grows weaker. Fire is strong when it helps, not when it hurts.

[[Start the adventure->inizio-avventura]]

```gameEffects
{
  "enemyPowerModifier": -1,
  "firstRoundOnly": true
}
```

:: inizio-avventura
The road is long, but every step matters. Whether you win or lose, you are growing a little more.

:: evento-round-3 [mid-story]
A cold wind arrives from the mountains halfway through the journey. The enemies grow stronger, but you feel more courage inside you.

```gameEffects
{
  "hpBonus": 1,
  "enemyPowerModifier": 1,
  "roundSpecific": 3
}
```

:: epilogo-vittoria [ending victory]
Ember has become a warm light for everyone. You learned that fire is meant to protect friends, not destroy them.

:: epilogo-sconfitta [ending defeat]
Ember fades a little, but a small spark stays alive. Next time you will know how to use fire with even more care.
